    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "לתיכונה",
      "rationale": "'Go ya ka gare' — bahtagollo ba fapana: 'ka phapošong ya ka gare' (KJV 'by the midst') goba 'ka go ya ka gare ga tempole' (go sepela go tsena ka go gare)."
